WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.470
Light a candle.

2
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:06.790
Use its flame to light a second candle,
then use that one to light a third.

3
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.860
Now look at the third flame.

4
00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:12.350
Is it the same flame you
started with, or a new one?

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.780
Buddhists use this picture
for samsara: birth,

6
00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.080
death and rebirth, over and over.

7
00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.330
And the Buddha taught that
nothing exists on its own.

8
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:26.840
So what holds the world together, and
why does that matter for suffering?

9
00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:30.650
In this mission, you'll find out
what Buddhists mean by Dhamma.

10
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.970
Then you'll test a short formula that
explains how suffering keeps going,

11
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.740
and how it can end.

12
00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:40.080
Your mission: find out what
holds the world together,

13
00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:41.950
and why it matters for suffering.
